flowchart LR
  Raw[UCI source + pinned hashes] --> RDD[textFile: map / filter / flatMap / reduceByKey]
  RDD --> DF[Explicit schema and quality diagnostics]
  DF --> SQL[SQL summaries and hourly features]
  SQL --> Calibration[Train through 2008 / calibrate 2009]
  DF --> Files[Real minute observations arriving as files]
  Files --> Windows[Finite input filter / watermark / hourly windows]
  Calibration --> Windows
  Windows --> Status[Coverage status / score / null or boolean alert]
  Status --> Sink[Checkpoint and idempotent batch directories]
  SQL --> Reference[Independent batch reference]
  Sink --> Compare[Key-set and aggregate/decision comparison]
  Reference --> Compare
